📗
  🚧🔸🌐 An error that carries a problem. A handler or a layer of middleware
  raises one to fail with a status of its choosing:

    🚨 🆕🚧🔸🌐 404 🔤No todo with that id🔤❗️
    🚨 🧨 🚩 🆕🆘 400❗️ 🔤title🔤 🔤is required🔤❗️❗️

  Any other error is unexpected, and is answered with a 500.
